<p>Attack your foes in a frontal arc, doing <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">131%, 144%, 154%, 162%, 170%</acronym> weapon damage and making your targets bleed for 0 each turn for <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">4, 5, 6, 7, 8</acronym> turns.</p><p>The bleed damage increases with your main hand weapon damage and Dexterity.</p>